  "remarks": "Oleg Belozerov is the Director General and Chairman of the Executive Board of Russian Railways, a state-owned company. Prior to his appointment to this position in 2015, he served as First Deputy Minister of Transport of the Russian Federation (2015), Deputy Minister of Transport of the Russian Federation (2009-2015) and the head of the Russian Federal Road Agency (2004-2009).",
